WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.728
Confirm the exact school and record. This uses the real app editor with synthetic training records. Check the school, family or employee before changing a field.

00:00:10.728 --> 00:00:21.360
Open the correct child and date. Expand Daily Report. Confirm the child and school day before recording meals, naps or activities.

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:32.167
Enter an objective meal note. Use the actual observation. This synthetic example describes lunch without including another child’s information.

00:00:32.167 --> 00:00:42.799
Write a parent-ready note. Review wording and keep the note specific to this child. Check the complete report before saving or sharing.

00:00:42.799 --> 00:00:55.077
Review before saving. In normal use, confirm the save result and whether the report was shared. A saved draft does not prove that parents received it. No report is saved here.

